error[E0443]: closure captures 'x' before it is assigned
 --> $DIR/generator-last-capture.nra:5:15
  |
3 |     last x: int;
  |          - declared here without a value
4 |     let g = iterator() -> int {
  |             -------- the closure is created here, before 'x' is assigned
5 |         yield x;
  |               ^ 'x' is captured here
  |
  = note: a closure copies the values it captures when it is created
  = help: assign 'x' before creating the closure

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0443`.
